  "wildways.guide.quest.shell": "Endermite Shells",
  "wildways.guide.quest.shell.description": "Pick up an Endermite Shell. Look for Endermites in the Quarantine Grounds or try throwing Ender Pearls.",
  "wildways.guide.quest.nest": "A Nest of Your Own",
  "wildways.guide.quest.nest.description": "Obtain an Endermite Nest. Surround a chest with eight Endermite Shells to craft one. Leave an Eye of Ender inside to let it transform.",
  "wildways.guide.quest.bricks": "Endermite Masonry",
  "wildways.guide.quest.bricks.description": "Obtain Endermite Bricks. Craft them from four Stone Bricks and one Endermite Shell. A stonecutter can turn them into slabs, stairs and walls.",
  "wildways.guide.quest.bait": "Beetroot Dough",
  "wildways.guide.quest.bait.description": "Obtain Beetroot Dough. Craft it with wheat and beetroot, then combine it with a fishing rod to load 16 bait charges.",
  "wildways.guide.quest.rich_fish": "A Filling Catch",
  "wildways.guide.quest.rich_fish.description": "Obtain a rich fish. Fish with Beetroot Dough and follow the target when the bobber dips. Rich fish sparkle and give more saturation.",
  "wildways.guide.quest.compass": "Find Your Bearings",
  "wildways.guide.quest.compass.description": "Obtain a compass and hold it to see your coordinates and the direction you are facing.",
  "wildways.guide.quest.biome_compass": "A Compass for Biomes",
  "wildways.guide.quest.biome_compass.description": "Obtain a Biome Compass from a Wandering Trader. Use it to select a biome in your current dimension and follow the needle.",
  "wildways.guide.quest.quartz_tool": "A Quartz Edge",
  "wildways.guide.quest.quartz_tool.description": "Obtain a Quartz Pickaxe. At a smithing table, refine an Iron Pickaxe with quartz and a Quartz Refinement.",
  "wildways.guide.quest.volcanite_tool": "Forged in Basalt",
  "wildways.guide.quest.volcanite_tool.description": "Obtain a Volcanite Ingot and a Volcanite Pickaxe. Look for Raw Volcanite in Basalt Deltas, smelt it and use a smithing table to refine a pickaxe.",
  "wildways.guide.quest.rune_enchanting": "Runes and Recipes",
  "wildways.guide.quest.rune_enchanting.description": "Obtain an enchanting rune and enchant an item. At the enchanting table, use a reusable enchanted book, lapis and a rune for the desired level.",
  "wildways.guide.quest.mending": "Make It Last",
  "wildways.guide.quest.mending.description": "Obtain a piece of gear with Mending. Combine it with one matching repair material at an anvil to restore its durability for XP.",
  "wildways.guide.quest.unease": "A Little Unease",
  "wildways.guide.quest.unease.description": "Brew a Potion of Unease with an Endermite Shell and an Awkward Potion. Brew Strong Unease by adding glowstone dust. Take each potion from the brewing stand.",
  "wildways.guide.quest.brewing_eye": "Eye of Brewing",
  "wildways.guide.quest.brewing_eye.description": "Obtain an Eye of Brewing. Brew an Eye of Ender with nether wart, then phantom membrane, then a ghast tear.",
  "wildways.guide.quest.portal_eye": "Eyes of the Wild",
  "wildways.guide.quest.portal_eye.description": "Find a WildWays portal eye. Igloo chests contain an Eye of Ice. You can also craft an Eye of Storm with an Eye of Ender, Breeze Rods and Wind Charges.",
  "wildways.guide.quest.enter_end": "Into the End",
  "wildways.guide.quest.enter_end.description": "Enter the End. To open an End portal, fill its twelve frames with twelve different WildWays portal eyes.",
  "wildways.guide.quest.summon_wither": "Summon the Wither",
  "wildways.guide.quest.summon_wither.description": "Summon a Wither by placing three Wither Skeleton Skulls across the top of a T made of soul sand or soul soil.",
  "wildways.guide.quest.defeat_wither": "Defeat the Wither",
  "wildways.guide.quest.defeat_wither.description": "Defeat a Wither. Use its Nether Star to craft a beacon. Activating that beacon for the first time grants bonus XP."
}
